{"id":"wb-3-138","name":"云龙寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"云龙寺塔","text":"云龙寺塔位于中国广东省韶关市仁化县董塘镇安岗村，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n云龙寺原称西山寺，清代改称云龙寺。云龙寺塔建于唐乾宁至光化年间，明代重修。塔为五层平座楼阁式实心砖塔，平面正方形，高13米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%91%E9%BE%99%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":85957179,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85957179","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b05b9f53653960e3e542b200.jpg","title":"Renhua_Yunlong_Si_Ta_2013.12.08_16-22-25.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Renhua_Yunlong_Si_Ta_2013.12.08_16-22-25.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/Renhua_Yunlong_Si_Ta_2013.12.08_16-22-25.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"仁化县云龙寺塔","width":320,"height":213}}